Description: mangowm with Margarida-OS patches (Wayland compositor)
 A tiling Wayland compositor based on wlroots and scenefx, with the
 patches carried by the Margarida-OS fork (hidden fullscreen mirroring
 in a movable corner, _NET_WM_WINDOW_OPACITY for hidden X11 containers).
 .
 The build requires libwlroots-0.20-dev and libscenefx-0.5-dev, which
 are only available in Debian unstable (forky). The resulting binary
 runs on Debian testing once those runtime libraries are present.